      {
        "unit_id": "snapshot-unit:8b37b06a1cf66b7cf3680f2ec589970fea957b489c0c2ec3294fa7113e58b026",
        "chunk_id": "chunk:signed-non-table-target-scope",
        "kind": "prose",
        "locator": "char:25-134",
        "text": "基准：2026-08-28 收盘 64.04 元（mx-xuangu）。中报口径来自 2026-08-11 上交所半年报全文及 8/12 摘要（新浪指定披露镜像交叉）。本报告只对标的本身做独立判断，不针对任何已有仓位。",
        "text_sha256": "sha256:e949b8a971f465ea985ae06f01b5ba5c391e27e8625f694f5d9faa519803aa45",
        "span": {
          "coordinate_system": "unicode_code_points",
